{"data":{"appliedContentFormat":"html","id":"1390498","key":"RCS-29055","fields":{"summary":"Kohl's Corporation - Idle Timer Too Short","description":"<p>Good Afternoon,</p><p>The various investigations teams are reporting widespread issues with the new “idle timer” for automatic logout.  This timer is fast enough that a single phone call can cause Secure to logout which also causes most investigators to lose their progress by sending them back to the Kohls home page.  </p><p>Please increase the automatic logout timer to 60 minutes or remove it entirely as Kohls laptops handle this security risk on their own with auto-lock without causing loss of progress in work.  We had a very short timer in the initial launch of Secure 5 and it was removed for the same reason.</p><p>This change does not appear to have been documented in the release notes.</p><p>Thank you,</p>","status":{"name":"Under Customer Review","statusCategory":{"name":"To Do"}},"assignee":{"accountId":"712020:153a3fea-8720-4528-b10f-5196a5d5fb21","displayName":"Enrique Jimenez"},"reporter":{"accountId":"qm:77071153-8149-425d-9cc5-2ef53c35a3bd:67c18952-dd38-454f-b2c1-dad0161cebb4","displayName":"Kyle Kimmerly"},"priority":{"name":"Medium"},"issuetype":{"id":"10102","name":"Incident"},"created":"2026-09-22T14:40:26.820-0400","updated":"2026-10-02T13:17:05.265-0400","labels":[],"subtasks":[],"comment":{"total":7},"issuelinks":[],"customFields":{"Problem":{"id":"customfield_15195","value":{"value":"Other","id":"26299"}},"Severity":{"id":"customfield_15199","value":{"value":"3 - Normal","id":"16560"}},"Product Type":{"id":"customfield_15196","value":{"value":"Secure 5 - EBR","id":"28531"}},"[CHART] Date of First Response":{"id":"customfield_21746","value":"2026-09-22T14:41:23.515-0400"},"Monitor":{"id":"customfield_15191","value":"https://prtg.solutions-sysrepublic.com/"},"Target Assignment Time":{"id":"customfield_18575","value":{"id":"53","name":"Target Assignment Time","completedCycles":[{"startTime":{"iso86